==Other Appearances==
==={{AoC|-}}===
{{Noncanon|Start}}
{{Descriptions AoC}}
The Barbarian Helm is a piece of [[Attire]] that can only be worn by [[Link]], and it is obtained by completing the [[Challenge]] "[[Anti-Element Training]]". It can also be [[Dye]]d at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]].

