{{Noncanon|End}}

==Trivia==
* As with other [[Barbarian Set]] pieces, upgrading a Barbarian Helm to level ★★ reduces its [[Sell Price]] by 60 [[Rupee]]s. Level ★★★ Barbarian Helms sell for the same price as level ★ Barbarian Helms. No other [[Enhancing|Enhancement]]s in the game decreases the Armor's Sell Price.

